; KrishMix EA6 - Timeframe Selector  |  attach ONCE, on any chart
;
; Places no orders. Decides scalp / intraday / swing per symbol and publishes
; the working timeframe for EA1 and EA5 to read.
;
; The dominant term is spread economics: scalping only works while the spread
; is small next to the range a bar actually delivers. On gold and the indices
; that single test rules scalping out for most of the session, which is the
; honest answer rather than a flattering one.
;
; Leave InpSymbols empty to cover only this chart's symbol.
InpSymbols=
InpSpreadScalpMax=0.25
InpSpreadIntraMax=0.6
InpRefTf=5
InpTrendTf=16385
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpAtrAvgPeriod=100
InpAdxPeriod=14
InpVolLow=0.75
InpVolHigh=1.3
InpAdxTrending=25
InpLiquidFrom=8
InpLiquidTo=20
InpAllowScalp=true
InpAllowIntraday=true
InpAllowSwing=true
InpRecheckSeconds=60
InpLogChanges=true
InpShowPanel=true
